PROJECT MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

Automatic Customer Complaint Analysis – Full-Stack Web Application

1. Project Overview

Develop a complete, professional, secure, and responsive web-based application named:

Automatic Customer Complaint Analysis System

The purpose of this application is to automatically analyze customer complaints, identify the nature of each complaint, classify complaints into appropriate categories using an existing Machine Learning model, discover potential new complaint groups, and generate analytical summaries and downloadable reports.

The application is intended for organizational use by authorized employees and administrators. Multiple registered users should be able to access the application through a shared web server using individual accounts.

The application must replace the existing local Streamlit interface with a modern full-stack web application.

The application must be completely developed and tested before deployment.

Important scope restriction: Do not deploy the application to any external server. The teacher will independently handle server configuration and deployment. The development deliverables must include a complete application, source code, database migrations, user manual, and deployment manual.

